  "guidelines": "- 35 x 10 mm polystyrene Petri dish from Corning\n- Commercial fungicide (Miconazole nitrate, 20 mg/L)\n- Culture room for the\u00a0fungal growth (26 + 2 \u00b0C at 12/12 h photoperiod)\u00a0\n- Microscope Axioplan from Zeiss\n- Everything must be done in a laminar flow hood\n ",
