    "section": "Dilution of the aqueous extract of leaves ",
    "section_color": null,
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "1. Performs three dilutions from the 10 % aqueous extract (AE) \n\n<table class=\"component-table\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n%s</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n%s\n</tbody>\n</table>\r\n \n CS-\u00a0conidial suspension (200 conidium/\u03bcL)\n\nDo not add de CS, only make the mix of AE and water, CS is added tube by tube\n ",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 19184,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "",
    "duration": 0,
    "original_id": 659899,
    "number": "1",
