    "critical": null
   },
   {
    "id": 696466,
    "guid": "6DF9773D7D644BE4896FC75AD6E56656",
    "previous_id": 696465,
    "previous_guid": "3721C880D1DC405DA971516DC43F67F1",
    "section": "Dilution of the aqueous extract of leaves",
    "section_color": null,
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": " \n- Add to a sterile 1.5 mL eppendorf tube mix 1 and then 12.5 \u03bcL of CS (in duplicate)\n- Repeat num 1 for the next concentrati\u00f3n and so on..\n- For the 10% AE just put in each tube 125 \u03bcL 10% AE plus 12.5 \u03bcL of CS,\u00a0(in duplicate)\n- The positive control is prepared by adding 1 \u03bcL of a commercial fungicide to 125 \u03bcL of water and\u00a012.5 \u03bcL of CS (in duplicate)\n- Two negative controls: one\u00a0 is only 125 \u03bcL of water and the other is 125 \u03bcL of PDB and both with 12.5 \u03bcL of CS (in duplicate)",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 19184,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "",
    "duration": 0,
    "original_id": 659911,
    "number": "2",
    "cases": [],
    "critical": null
   },
   {
    "id": 696467,
    "guid": "BA0DABD1794D43B89D9CC65FC7DFDAF2",
    "previous_id": 696466,
    "previous_guid": "6DF9773D7D644BE4896FC75AD6E56656",
    "section": "Bioassay conditions",
    "section_color": null,
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "Once the conidial suspension has been added, homogenize very well, seal the tubes and leave them in the dark at a temperature of 26-28 \u00b0 C for 3 days.",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 19184,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "",
    "duration": 0,
    "original_id": 659914,
    "number": "3",
    "cases": [],
    "critical": null
   },
   {
    "id": 696468,
    "guid": "BA6870E6B89645099211F3AF9226A129",
    "previous_id": 696467,
    "previous_guid": "BA0DABD1794D43B89D9CC65FC7DFDAF2",
    "section": "Bioassay conditions",
    "section_color": null,
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "After three days, 25 \u03bcL of the suspension is transferred in the center of the PDA medium (polystyrene dish, Corning),\u00a0in duplicate.\u00a0\n\nThe suspension of each eppendorf tube must be perfectly homogenized\n ",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 19184,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "",
    "duration": 0,
    "original_id": 659915,
    "number": "4",
    "cases": [],
    "critical": null
   },
   {
