    "guid": "005166BB7EF64002BA77A07494F9030C",
    "previous_id": 696468,
    "previous_guid": "BA6870E6B89645099211F3AF9226A129",
    "section": "Bioassay conditions",
    "section_color": null,
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "1. Petri dishes are\u00a0incubated at 26\u00a0\u00b1 2 \u00b0C at 12/12 photoperiod for 7 days (two replicates /concentration)\n1. Evaluation are made on day 7\n\n\nIf the aqueous extract of leaves is fungicidal there should be no growth on the PDA medium, if the extract is not fungicidal then there must be growth of the fungus on the PDA medium\n ",
